@host=http://localhost:8080
@accessToken=replace-with-admin-access-token

### List categories
GET {{host}}/api/v1/categories

### Create category
POST {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

name=Gameplay&description=Gameplay+changes

### Update category
PATCH {{host}}/api/v1/categories
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

name=Gameplay&description=Updated+description

### Delete category
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/categories?category=Gameplay
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
